ackground:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4def5;border-radius:10px;"><span class="a-ink2" style="display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:#51497f;">Vencido</span><span class="a-ink" style="display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1b1736;line-height:1.3;">R$&nbsp;1.240,00 · 19%</span></div></div><ul style="margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:18px;"><li class="a-ink2" style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#51497f;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">R$&nbsp;980,00 vencem nos próximos 7 dias (6 parcelas)</li><li class="a-ink2" style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#51497f;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">3 clientes com mais de 30 dias de atraso</li><li class="a-ink2" style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#51497f;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">9 vendas no fiado esta semana, 29% das vendas</li></ul><div style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0;line-height:0;"><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;margin:0 8px 8px 0;border-collapse:separate;"><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#f1ecfd" class="a-lkbg" style="background:#f1ecfd;border:1px solid #d8c9fa;border-radius:9px;mso-padding-alt:12px 16px;"><a href="https://app.getaura.com.br/crediario?empresa=11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111" class="a-lk" style="display:block;padding:12px 16px;color:#6d28d9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:9px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Ver o crediário</a></td></tr></table></div></td></tr></table>
